cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this curriculum or its materials, please cite it as below."
title: "tony-stark: a self-enhancement lab from silicon to robots to AI"
abstract: >-
  An open, test-driven curriculum in thirteen "Marks": systems programming,
  computer architecture, operating systems, embedded systems, control,
  manipulation, estimation and SLAM, GPU perception, LLM agents, and advanced
  robotics (rigid-body dynamics, optimal control and legged locomotion, robot
  learning), with graduate-level chapters, validated test suites, and
  annotated references.
type: software
authors:
